-- test: at the result of a function type in the state, the data flows the way of the hand-off: `init` returns a function whose result is `secret`, and a `step` whose state declares that result `public` would read `secret` data as `public`, so it is U4001 (spec/26 §2, issue #1644)
-- spec: spec/26 §2
-- expect: error U4001 at src/counter.una:10:18
module counter

import std.drive (Tick)

pub init() -> fn(Int) -> secret Int = double

pub step(edit f: fn(Int) -> Int, input: Tick) -> Unit = unit

double(x: Int) -> secret Int = x * 2
